  "sourceTitle": "Deploy GPT-J 6B for inference using Hugging Face Transformers and Amazon SageMaker",
  "sourceBodyHash": "e5960a2fed56dbe15ce639f72c3428f85a3d65bb2197ce5281fee1ecc787e9f4",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "zcode",
  "requestedModel": "",
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T04:57:03.266033Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T04:57:03.266033Z",
  "totalBlocks": 58,
  "translatedBlocks": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0286d0d876f86c2f",
      "translationZh": "几乎整整 6 个月前，EleutherAI 发布了 GPT-J 6B——OpenAI GPT-3 的开源替代品。GPT-J 6B 是 EleutherAI GPT-NEO 系列的 60 亿参数后继者，该系列是基于 GPT 架构、面向文本生成的 Transformer 语言模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f32288e3c0e80472",
      "translationZh": "EleutherAI 的首要目标是训练一个与 GPT⁠-⁠3 规模相当的模型，并以开放许可向公众提供。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b62de1de5f0ca0f9",
      "translationZh": "过去 6 个月，GPT-J 获得了研究者、数据科学家甚至软件开发者的广泛关注，但要把 GPT-J 部署到真实用例和产品的生产环境中，仍然非常困难。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26bef1631f4ee36b",
      "translationZh": "有一些托管方案可用于 GPT-J 的生产负载，比如 Hugging Face Inference API，或者用 EleutherAI 的 6b playground 做实验，但关于如何把它轻松部署到自己环境的示例要少得多。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31873a52acf57589",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，你将学到如何用 Amazon SageMaker 和 Hugging Face Inference Toolkit，只需几行代码就能部署 GPT-J，在一台常规尺寸、搭载 NVIDIA T4（约 500 美元/月）的 GPU 实例上实现可扩展、可靠、安全的实时推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c443d7a4c6401fa",
      "translationZh": "但在深入之前，我想先解释为什么把 GPT-J 部署到生产环境很困难。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea2b8a878841df59",
      "translationZh": "背景",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa43fa5f17495186",
      "translationZh": "这个 60 亿参数模型的权重约占 24GB 内存。以 float32 加载它，至少需要 2 倍模型大小的 CPU 内存：1 倍用于初始权重，另 1 倍用于加载检查点。所以对 GPT-J 来说，仅加载模型就至少需要 48GB CPU 内存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0605d2f232cf33c",
      "translationZh": "为了让模型更容易使用，EleutherAI 也提供了 float16 权重，transformers 也新增了加载大型语言模型时降低内存占用的选项。把这些结合起来，加载模型大约需要 12.1GB CPU 内存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e603fd9fa808296c",
      "translationZh": "这个示例的坑在于：模型加载进内存并可用之前要花很长时间。在我的实验中，在 P3.2xlarge AWS EC2 实例上用上面的代码加载模型花了 3 分 32 秒（模型未存于磁盘）。把模型预先存在磁盘上可以把加载时间降到 1 分 23 秒——对需要考虑扩展性和可靠性的生产负载来说仍然太长。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0fb3fd1be162e12",
      "translationZh": "例如，Amazon SageMaker 对请求响应有 60 秒上限，意味着模型加载和预测都必须在 60 秒内完成——我认为这对保持模型/端点在你的负载下的可扩展性和可靠性非常合理。如果你的预测耗时更长，可以用 batch-transform。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13c86f3a6d2cfef4",
      "translationZh": "在 Transformers 中，用 from_pretrained 方法加载模型遵循的是 PyTorch 的推荐做法，BERT 大约需要 1.97 秒 [REF]。PyTorch 还提供了用 torch.save(model, PATH) 和 torch.load(PATH) 保存与加载模型的另一种方式。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7233726fb2d16365",
      "translationZh": "“用这种方式保存模型会使用 Python 的 pickle 模块保存整个模块。这种方法的缺点是，序列化数据与保存模型时使用的特定类和确切目录结构绑定。”",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f8296ce9c5f7fbb",
      "translationZh": "这意味着用 transformers==4.13.2 保存的模型，在用 transformers==4.15.0 加载时可能不兼容。不过，这种方式能把加载时间缩短约 12 倍，BERT 降到 0.166 秒。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfb66d2b5f623706",
      "translationZh": "把这一方法用于 GPT-J，意味着我们可以把加载时间从 1 分 23 秒降到 7.7 秒，快了约 10.5 倍。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0791c06f5672cb47",
      "translationZh": "图 1. BERT 与 GPT-J 的模型加载时间",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c26982b1425da26a",
      "translationZh": "教程",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "835c93d744bd35bf",
      "translationZh": "有了这种保存与加载模型的方法，GPT-J 的模型加载性能就能胜任生产场景。但要记住，我们需要对齐：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "725baa6f3d2f690d",
      "translationZh": "用 torch.save(model,PATH) 保存、用 torch.load(PATH) 加载时，要对齐 PyTorch 与 Transformers 的版本，避免不兼容。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7d104d6009ce713",
      "translationZh": "用 torch.save 保存 GPT-J",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ad68a4c482b6f1e",
      "translationZh": "要生成兼容 torch.load() 的模型文件，我们先用 Transformers 的 from_pretrained 方法加载 GPT-J，再用 torch.save() 保存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6920d9b9c5c31d8d",
      "translationZh": "现在就能用 torch.load() 加载我们的 GPT-J 模型来跑预测了。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22eec44bedd41852",
      "translationZh": "为 Amazon SageMaker 实时端点创建 model.tar.gz",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f3294e8e4d324f0",
      "translationZh": "既然我们能快速加载模型并跑推理，那就把它部署到 Amazon SageMaker 吧。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "042ea1f37cd72d8c",
      "translationZh": "把 transformers 部署到 Amazon SageMaker 有两种方式：可以直接“部署来自 Hugging Face Hub 的模型”，或“用存放在 S3 上的 model_data 部署模型”。由于我们没有用默认的 Transformers 方式，就要选第二种，用存放在 S3 上的模型部署端点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40d881093accfb65",
      "translationZh": "为此，需要创建一个 model.tar.gz 工件，包含模型权重和推理所需的其他文件，例如 tokenizer.json。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb1a57d1884be2d2",
      "translationZh": "我们已上传并公开了可用的 model.tar.gz 工件，可配合 HuggingFaceModel 把 GPT-J 部署到 Amazon SageMaker。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1966582056c66d7",
      "translationZh": "如何使用见“把 GPT-J 部署为 Amazon SageMaker 端点”。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e4f83d5039c8157",
      "translationZh": "如果你仍然想或需要创建自己的 model.tar.gz（比如出于合规要求），可以用辅助脚本 convert_gpt.py，它会创建 model.tar.gz 并上传到 S3。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ebdf9d07c3eea04",
      "translationZh": "convert_gpt.py 应该会打印出类似这样的 S3 URI：s3://hf-sagemaker-inference/gpt-j/model.tar.gz。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "540a453c32234867",
      "translationZh": "把 GPT-J 部署为 Amazon SageMaker 端点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a341e63c4770ff65",
      "translationZh": "部署 Amazon SageMaker 端点要用 Amazon SageMaker Python SDK 和 HuggingFaceModel 类。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57615599ce855f9b",
      "translationZh": "下面的代码片段用到了 get_execution_role，它只在 Amazon SageMaker Notebook Instance 或 Studio 内可用。若要在其外部部署模型，请查阅文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3395f7cf81094b6e",
      "translationZh": "model_uri 定义了我们 GPT-J 模型工件的位置。我们将使用我们提供的公开工件。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5cde03a8fc3b3a5",
      "translationZh": "如果你想用自己的 model.tar.gz，只需把 model_uri 换成你的 S3 URI。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f311838bf73e2a8",
      "translationZh": "部署大约需要 3-5 分钟。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dfcb5863020129ab",
      "translationZh": "运行预测",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d56cde0b66cc1378",
      "translationZh": "我们可以用 .deploy 方法创建的 predictor 实例运行预测。用 predictor.predict 并带上我们的 inputs 即可向端点发送请求。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64d3daeb7cd4dd10",
      "translationZh": "如果想用 min_length 等额外的 kwargs 定制预测，请看下面的“使用最佳实践”。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aefdb9fc0011c2f2",
      "translationZh": "使用最佳实践",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ddfa78fd35f53c7",
      "translationZh": "使用生成模型时，多数时候你会想配置或定制预测以满足需求，例如使用束搜索、配置生成序列的 max 或 min 长度、调节 temperature 以减少重复。Transformers 库提供了不同的策略和 kwargs，Hugging Face 推理工具包通过请求负载的 parameters 属性提供同样的能力。下面给出不带参数、使用束搜索、以及使用自定义配置生成文本的示例。想了解不同的解码策略，请看这篇博文。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "35b991f7b93ae8be",
      "translationZh": "默认请求",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58cd4f12f7768a71",
      "translationZh": "这是一个使用贪婪搜索的默认请求示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9ebdacf6532949a",
      "translationZh": "首个请求之后的推理耗时：3 秒",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d894a523684ac16e",
      "translationZh": "束搜索请求",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a46a5d32fdaa02a",
      "translationZh": "这是一个使用 5 束束搜索的请求示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e33d22d35fa38327",
      "translationZh": "首个请求之后的推理耗时：3.3 秒",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f9600ca98f62fee7",
      "translationZh": "带参数请求",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae19575505857468",
      "translationZh": "这是一个使用自定义参数的请求示例，例如 min_length 用于至少生成 512 个 token。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "222a8f2428298f75",
      "translationZh": "首个请求之后的推理耗时：38 秒",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2dc163a089985b49",
      "translationZh": "少样本示例（进阶）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94bbb8f24fd93473",
      "translationZh": "这是一个演示如何用 eos_token_id 在特定 token（如 \\n 、. 或 ###）处停止生成、实现少样本预测的示例。下面是一个按关键词生成推文的少样本示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fa20e90dd6a472c",
      "translationZh": "首个请求之后的推理耗时：15-45 秒",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ce48cc7565bc7a8",
      "translationZh": "要删除端点，可以运行：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e480f0833b8f1edd",
      "translationZh": "我们成功地用 Amazon SageMaker 部署了 GPT-J——这个由 EleutherAI 打造的 60 亿参数语言模型。我们把模型加载时间从 3.5 分钟降到 8 秒，从而能够运行可扩展、可靠的推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cb674df2470c9b0",
      "translationZh": "请记住，torch.save() 与 torch.load() 可能带来不兼容问题。想进一步了解如何扩展 Amazon SageMaker 端点，请看我另一篇博文：MLOps: End-to-End Hugging Face Transformers with the Hub & SageMaker Pipelines。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a65764164eb4540",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如有任何问题，欢迎通过 GitHub 或论坛联系我。也可以在 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 上与我联系。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "float16",
      "briefZh": "半精度",
      "explanationZh": "用 16 位浮点表示权重，内存占用减半"
    },
    {
      "term": "model.tar.gz",
      "briefZh": "模型工件包",
      "explanationZh": "SageMaker 部署所需的打包模型文件"
    },
    {
      "term": "beam search",
      "briefZh": "束搜索",
      "explanationZh": "保留多条候选序列的解码策略"
    },
    {
